    ],
    "text": "PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONS ACT. No. 1 OF 1981",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      203.13,
      343.21,
      384.59,
      354.28
    ],
    "text": "Filling of a Vacancy under Section 64 (5)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      379.21,
      540.03,
      438.28
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Secretary General of the Parliament has informed me under Section 64(5) of the Parliamentary ElectionsAct, No. 1 of 1981, as amended by Section 6 of the Elections (Special Provisions) Act, No. 35 of 1988, that a vacancy hasoccurred in the membership of the Eighth Parliament by reason of the resignation of Mr. Sarath Chandrasiri Mayadunnebeing a member nominated by the People's Liberation Front, a recognized political party, and declared elected as a Memberof Parliament under Article 99A of the Constitution ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      451.21,
      539.91,
      474.28
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of that Political Party was required by me under the aforesaid Section to nominate aneligible person to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      487.21,
      539.89,
      510.28
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the aforesaid Political Party has nominated Mr. Bimal Niroshan Rathnayake Weerakoonto fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      523.21,
      539.97,
      570.28
    ],
    "text": "Now therefore, I Mahinda Deshapriya, Commissioner of Elections, in the exercise of the powers conferrd on me bySection 64 (5) of the Parliamentary Elections Act. No. 1 of 1981, do hereby declare Mr. Bimal Niroshan Rathnayake Weerakoon,elected as a member of the Eighth Parliament to fill the vacancy caused by the resignation of aforesaid Mr .Sarath ChandrasiriMayadunne.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      425.85,
      583.21,
      533.86,
      606.28
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA DESHAPRIYA,Commissioner of Elections.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      631.21,
      135.95,
      666.28
    ],
    "text": "Elections Secretariat,Rajagiriya,14th September, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
